  "title": "Gluten-Free Zucchini Muffins",
  "description": "These gluten-free zucchini muffins use applesauce to keep them moist. Mix things up by adding some shredded carrot or nix the muffins completely and make zucchini bread instead.",
  "authors": [
    "nanzinmaine"
